; =====================================================================
; kdf-context.cddl
;
; VERBATIM.  The only CDDL RFC 9053 ships.  Copied unchanged out of the
; cached RFC 9053 text, lines 1168-1184, including the RFC's own
; three-space left page margin, its internal blank line and its
; spacing around ":" and "/".  It was NOT authored by this project.
; Do not edit, correct, dedent or reformat it.  Defects are recorded in
; README.md, never repaired here.
;
; Extraction status: verbatim.  Everything else in this directory that
; renders an RFC 9053 structure is DERIVED and carries `.derived.`.
;
; Locator:  RFC 9053, "CBOR Object Signing and Encryption (COSE):
;           Initial Algorithms", Schaad, August 2022, Informational,
;           ISSN 2070-1721.  Section 5.2, "Context Information
;           Structure", introduced by the sentence "The following CDDL
;           fragment corresponds to the text above."
;
; Standing, which matters for how this file may be cited:  RFC 9053
; Section 1.4 states that "the CBOR data objects defined here are
; described in prose" and that CDDL descriptions of COSE data objects
; are "(non-normative)".  This fragment is therefore a transcription of
; a non-normative rendering inside an Informational document.  The
; normative statement of COSE_KDF_Context is the Section 5.2 prose.
;
; `empty_or_serialized_map` is NOT defined here or anywhere in RFC
; 9053.  It is defined in RFC 9052 Section 3 as
; `bstr .cbor header_map / bstr .size 0`; see
; records/ietf/rfc-9052/distilled/schema/cose.cddl.  This file does not
; compile on its own.
; =====================================================================

; --- BEGIN VERBATIM: RFC 9053 §5.2, cached source lines 1168-1184 ----
   PartyInfo = (
       identity : bstr / nil,
       nonce : bstr / int / nil,
       other : bstr / nil
   )

   COSE_KDF_Context = [
       AlgorithmID : int / tstr,
       PartyUInfo : [ PartyInfo ],
       PartyVInfo : [ PartyInfo ],
       SuppPubInfo : [
           keyDataLength : uint,
           protected : empty_or_serialized_map,
           ? other : bstr
       ],
       ? SuppPrivInfo : bstr
   ]
; --- END VERBATIM ----------------------------------------------------
